; BIND zone file for socialskills.ninja
; Purpose: repoint apex + www from Cloudflare Tunnel to Vercel
; Imported via: Cloudflare DNS dashboard → "Import" button
; Pairs with manual deletion of the two existing Tunnel records first
;
; IMPORTANT: a BIND import ADDS records; it does not delete existing ones.
; Delete the two existing Tunnel-typed rows for @ and www BEFORE importing,
; or you'll have orphan records and a config conflict.

$ORIGIN socialskills.ninja.
$TTL 1   ; 1 = "Auto" in the Cloudflare UI

@     IN  A  76.76.21.21
www   IN  A  76.76.21.21
